Package: ROvis.utils
Title: Utilities for Rijksoverheid-Styled Data Visualizations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ROvis team", email = "spin@rivm.nl", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: Provides shared utilities for the ROvis suite, including Rijksoverheid
    color palettes, palette validation, and font-availability checks, so that themes
    across the ROvis packages stay consistent with official Rijksoverheid design
    guidelines.
